      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That is intended behaviour. If there is a major version mismatch you will only see those who have the same version like you do. So beta testers only see other beta testers and the same would go for people with old and out of date clients, they would only see someone if they happen to be on the same outdated version.\n\nSince you know they're in the beta your best bet to see them ingame again is to ask them to go back to the latest release version.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
