  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-19T04:35:42.853Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some of my friends are closed beta testers. It has been more than a couple of times I've seen a friend online in a public world, I then join off them to find there is no one there. This is very annoying. Sometimes the rooms hint at up and coming features that haven't been announced yet, which probably isn't a good thing to let any user join on and see.",
